  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shadow Sect paid a huge price to modify the life-and-death immortal aperture revival method, and Spectral Soul’s main body joined in, using the essence of human path, transformation path, and heaven path to create the Immortal Gu recipe for sovereign immortal fetus Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1031
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Five Elements Grandmaster can only read from The Legends of Ren Zu the meaning that human path triumphs over heaven path. He states that the trend of the rule of humanity cannot be overturned, and that even heaven is not its match.",
      "chapters": [
        1180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "against-human-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The concept of human path revolves around reducing deficits and increasing surpluses so the strong grow stronger. Heaven path takes away surpluses while replenishing deficits and emphasizes the balance of all myriad beings.",
      "chapters": [
        1654
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "balance-of-myriad-beings",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Crazed Demon Cave’s eighth layer, Fang Yuan recognizes heaven path. He had seen human path dao marks, but this is the first time he sees heaven path dao marks: a thread-like mark floating in the wind, twinkling with dazzling white light. Other dao marks are destroyed while heaven path dao marks remain. Small worlds birth and destroy around them, and deriving worlds is the superficial appearance of deriving heaven path dao marks. Fate Gu, in essence, is a fragment of heaven path.",
      "chapters": [
        1866
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-in-crazed-demon-cave",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has never heard of anyone cultivating heaven path before. The only known way he names then is to use human path methods to suppress heaven path.",
      "chapters": [
        1993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-rarity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fighting beside Fang Yuan, Paradise Earth activates the heaven path killer move Heavenly Web Protection Veil, a milky white light web that blocks Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s golden light rays.",
      "chapters": [
        2203
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-defense",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "move_heavenly_web_protection_veil",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Paradise Earth both use heaven path methods against Star Constellation Chessboard Formation, including Heavenly Summary Earthly Norm, whose power erases starry paths and restores void. Even though Paradise Earth only has pseudo venerable cultivation, he has converted to heaven path, and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable cannot yet ascertain his methods. The same stretch lists Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable as cultivating earth path and heaven path under the venerable pattern of one main path and one specialty path.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paradise-earth-conversion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_star_constellation_chessboard",
        "move_heavenly_summary_earthly_norm",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the five regions become one and the regional walls vanish, qi tides sweep the world while heaven veins and earth veins merge. Immortal materials appear in pouring abundance, and among them earth path, qi path, and heaven path are the most abundant.",
      "chapters": [
        2276
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heaven-vein-abundance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_material"
      ]
    }
